# Behavioral/structural source observation acceptance.
# Compile and link only. Native emission of `ac.observe` is not
# part of this owner, so this gate asserts that an accepted observation is
# published in the final design and that a rejected one is named -- never that
# emission succeeds.
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/source_observation_behavioral.py --repo %src --source-compiler %pycircuit_source_unit --linker %pycircuit_link --emitter %pycircuit_emit --scratch %t.dir
